00:23:14.500 --> 00:23:16.500
I almost died because of you.

287
00:23:30.950 --> 00:23:33.100
What does the guy look like
who left the colony?

288
00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:34.980
You will understand if you see him.

289
00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:37.280
Eugyom.

290
00:23:38.590 --> 00:23:42.060
They say a student has been transferred to third grade
and got into a fight with Nam Seungsik.

291
00:23:42.920 --> 00:23:44.980
- Why?
- In terms of?

292
00:23:45.060 --> 00:23:47.150
It's obvious that he wants to take over the school.

293
00:23:47.230 --> 00:23:48.530
If he kills Nam Seungsik,

294
00:23:49.060 --> 00:23:50.900
then you'll be next.

295
00:23:51.700 --> 00:23:52.900
Where to go?

296
00:23:53.670 --> 00:23:54.570
Wait.

297
00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:56.870
There is no need to fight right away.

298
00:23:57.400 --> 00:23:59.010
You need to study it first.

299
00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:01.380
Let's go now.

300
00:24:03.480 --> 00:24:04.710
OK.

301
00:24:13.650 --> 00:24:14.890
Straightaway?

302
00:24:27.430 --> 00:24:30.040
New kid here from high school?

303
00:24:33.310 --> 00:24:34.540
I recognized it right away.

304
00:24:35.640 --> 00:24:37.950
I heard about you, so I came.

305
00:24:38.850 --> 00:24:42.020
If you want to take over the school,
then you had to find

306
00:24:43.220 --> 00:24:44.990
Kim Uigyeom, not Nam Seungsik.

307
00:24:55.360 --> 00:24:57.060
Let's talk in a quiet place.

308
00:25:12.050 --> 00:25:13.710
Are you really Gwije from Mumyeon School?

309
00:25:15.880 --> 00:25:17.520
There was a misunderstanding.

310
00:25:18.150 --> 00:25:19.550
I don't want to fight.

311
00:25:20.620 --> 00:25:22.760
Then why did you fight with Nam Seungsik?

312
00:25:24.290 --> 00:25:26.030
I was just defending myself.

313
00:25:26.720 --> 00:25:27.930
Then protect yourself from me too.

314
00:25:43.910 --> 00:25:45.000
Hey Eugyeom!

315
00:25:45.080 --> 00:25:47.400
No need, this is not your opponent.

316
00:25:47.480 --> 00:25:49.340
- Move away.
- Listen to me, hey.

317
00:25:49.420 --> 00:25:50.500
Let's fight later.

318
00:25:50.580 --> 00:25:51.810
Please.

319
00:25:51.890 --> 00:25:52.850
I told you

320
00:25:54.260 --> 00:25:55.520
that I'm not going to fight.

321
00:25:56.390 --> 00:25:57.530
Do not touch me.

322
00:25:58.660 --> 00:26:00.260
If I fight, you will die.

323
00:26:00.930 --> 00:26:02.700
I'm serious.

324
00:26:03.330 --> 00:26:04.270
Wait.

325
00:26:05.030 --> 00:26:07.430
I've heard about you since middle school.

326
00:26:10.000 --> 00:26:12.070
I apologize for today's incident.

327
00:26:14.610 --> 00:26:17.040
We didn't want to fight, we just...

328
00:26:17.750 --> 00:26:20.350
We thought you did too
you like to fight like bullies.

329
00:26:22.280 --> 00:26:23.280
I'm sorry.

330
00:26:26.350 --> 00:26:28.040
Than your actions

331
00:26:28.120 --> 00:26:29.810
different from bullies?

332
00:26:29.890 --> 00:26:30.790
They are different.

333
00:26:31.530 --> 00:26:34.420
- We only beat up bad guys.
- Calm down.

334
00:26:34.500 --> 00:26:35.400
It's funny.

335
00:26:37.060 --> 00:26:38.700
Who decides who is bad?

336
00:26:40.230 --> 00:26:41.700
Am I good or bad?

337
00:26:45.140 --> 00:26:46.040
And you?

338
00:26:53.610 --> 00:26:56.050
Those who wave their fists
usually a bad ending.

339
00:26:58.350 --> 00:26:59.720
You have to experience it to understand.

340
00:27:00.590 --> 00:27:02.320
You will understand this yourself one day.

341
00:27:15.640 --> 00:27:18.460
Wow!
I almost shit myself seeing him live.

342
00:27:18.540 --> 00:27:19.710
Madness.

343
00:27:20.940 --> 00:27:22.280
Is he that strong?

344
00:27:22.810 --> 00:27:25.100
Even if it's ten
Kim Yygemov - useless.

345
00:27:25.180 --> 00:27:26.900
When everyone knows who he is,

346
00:27:26.980 --> 00:27:29.420
won't stay at school
not a single show-off.

347
00:27:30.450 --> 00:27:32.020
The school will become quiet.

348
00:27:32.990 --> 00:27:34.520
That's why strength is needed.

349
00:27:41.600 --> 00:27:42.500
So...

350
00:27:43.060 --> 00:27:44.350
they didn't fight?

351
00:27:44.430 --> 00:27:45.390
Yes.

352
00:27:45.470 --> 00:27:47.170
This new one...

353
00:27:47.800 --> 00:27:50.200
said he had no desire to fight.

354
00:27:51.440 --> 00:27:52.840
What?

355
00:27:53.710 --> 00:27:55.440
Why are they suddenly...

356
00:27:56.410 --> 00:27:58.380
show respect for other people's feelings?

357
00:28:01.980 --> 00:28:02.880
Seungsik,

358
00:28:05.550 --> 00:28:06.590
are you funny?

359
00:28:07.760 --> 00:28:10.460
Rumors spread around the school
that you were rebuffed by a first-year student.

360
00:28:12.130 --> 00:28:13.060
Is it true?

361
00:28:14.260 --> 00:28:16.800
And about the fact that he got you off?
first year, haven't you heard?

362
00:28:18.830 --> 00:28:19.700
Moomyeon School?

363
00:28:21.000 --> 00:28:23.900
Yes, this is the school I'm talking about
almost no one knows.

364
00:28:24.440 --> 00:28:27.910
This is a kind of experimental school,
very problematic place.

365
00:28:28.552 --> 00:28:30.530
Teenage delinquency
crossed the line.

366
00:28:30.610 --> 00:28:33.100
In juvenile detention centers
can't cope.

367
00:28:33.180 --> 00:28:35.240
When in one place
only hooligans are gathered,

368
00:28:35.320 --> 00:28:36.500
they get even worse.

369
00:28:36.580 --> 00:28:37.640
Isn't it?

370
00:28:37.720 --> 00:28:40.980
Therefore, children need to be reformed,
and not produce repeat offenders.

371
00:28:41.060 --> 00:28:44.910
Therefore, the Ministry of Education...
created an experimental school.

372
00:28:44.990 --> 00:28:47.110
There are several such schools throughout the country.

373
00:28:47.190 --> 00:28:50.330
It’s not like it’s a colony, but it’s not a school either...

374
00:28:50.800 --> 00:28:52.690
In any case, the teachers there...

375
00:28:52.770 --> 00:28:54.990
rather create an atmosphere of competition.

376
00:28:55.070 --> 00:28:58.640
They rank the kids based on their fighting skills.

377
00:29:00.740 --> 00:29:03.060
- Do you know about Samcheon Training Camp?
- Yes.

378
00:29:03.140 --> 00:29:05.530
They drove them there
and were treated like dogs.

379
00:29:05.610 --> 00:29:07.150
Imagine it's the same.

380
00:29:07.680 --> 00:29:09.870
But at Mumyeon school you need
fight every day.

381
00:29:09.950 --> 00:29:11.120
You can't help but fight.

382
00:29:13.390 --> 00:29:17.080
If you can't fight,
then you will live like a complete slob.

383
00:29:17.160 --> 00:29:20.680
The fact that Gwidzhe
transferred to a regular school means...

384
00:29:22.160 --> 00:29:24.370
that he came out of Mumyeon in charge.

385
00:29:25.670 --> 00:29:27.860
If you're in charge there,
you can transfer.

386
00:29:27.940 --> 00:29:31.330
That's why they fight so hard.

387
00:29:31.410 --> 00:29:32.340
Understood?

388
00:29:37.410 --> 00:29:38.530
Oh damn, hey!

389
00:29:38.610 --> 00:29:39.510
This is Gwidzhe!

390
00:29:40.600 --> 00:29:41.900
If he is on our side...

391
00:29:41.980 --> 00:29:44.080
then we had nothing
would be afraid in this world.

392
00:29:52.290 --> 00:29:53.830
What's going on here?

393
00:29:58.100 --> 00:30:00.070
- Grab this bastard!
- Hey, let's go!

394
00:30:01.040 --> 00:30:02.320
Wow, cool, hey!

395
00:30:02.400 --> 00:30:04.460
Eygyom, let's go have a look! Quickly, let's go!

396
00:30:04.540 --> 00:30:07.070
Hey, let's take a look, quickly!
Quickly, quickly, come here!

397
00:30:29.630 --> 00:30:30.500
Hey!

398
00:30:43.980 --> 00:30:44.910
What?

399
00:30:45.610 --> 00:30:46.650
Were you waiting for me?

400
00:30:49.950 --> 00:30:51.550
Do you really need this?

401
00:30:54.860 --> 00:30:56.380
Impressive.

402
00:30:56.460 --> 00:30:58.060
Still a legend of the Mumyeon school.

403
00:30:58.790 --> 00:31:00.630
I didn't know you were so famous.

404
00:31:02.130 --> 00:31:03.000
How about...

405
00:31:03.800 --> 00:31:05.370
play a game with me?

406
00:31:09.440 --> 00:31:10.770
I'm speaking for the last time.

407
00:31:11.810 --> 00:31:13.610
I'll be as quiet as a mouse.

408
00:31:15.840 --> 00:31:17.380
Let's finish this.

409
00:31:19.810 --> 00:31:21.250
What charisma!

410
00:31:22.420 --> 00:31:23.750
But it's too late.

411
00:31:24.650 --> 00:31:26.450
It's about my pride.

412
00:31:43.720 --> 00:31:45.310
Whoever crosses is a corpse.

413
00:31:45.960 --> 00:31:47.170
Steep.

414
00:31:49.080 --> 00:31:50.710
What are you doing? I'm not finished yet.

415
00:32:02.760 --> 00:32:03.660
Let's get this over with.

416
00:32:23.010 --> 00:32:24.010
Get out of the way.

417
00:32:25.250 --> 00:32:26.350
If you want to live.

418
00:32:44.330 --> 00:32:45.300
Gwidzhe!

419
00:32:45.800 --> 00:32:46.900
Gwidzhe!

420
00:32:47.670 --> 00:32:48.700
Wait!

421
00:32:50.740 --> 00:32:52.970
Wow, you really are a legend, huh?

422
00:32:53.840 --> 00:32:56.400
Once again I apologize for
what happened earlier.

423
00:33:01.650 --> 00:33:02.650
That guy...

424
00:33:03.220 --> 00:33:04.350
looked dangerous.

425
00:33:05.590 --> 00:33:06.970
You know this too, right?

426
00:33:07.050 --> 00:33:09.110
Don't just look at him in a bad way.

427
00:33:09.190 --> 00:33:10.480
You said it yourself.

428
00:33:10.560 --> 00:33:11.450
Need to experience it.

429
00:33:11.530 --> 00:33:13.860
We are also currently in the process of testing.

430
00:33:15.760 --> 00:33:18.620
But you don't want to get into trouble.

431
00:33:18.700 --> 00:33:21.920
If rumors of a fight spread
at school, you will have problems.

432
00:33:23.700 --> 00:33:25.110
I filmed it.

433
00:33:27.310 --> 00:33:29.800
If I ever need help,

434
00:33:29.880 --> 00:33:32.010
could you help just once?

435
00:33:33.680 --> 00:33:35.400
Are you blackmailing me now?

436
00:33:35.480 --> 00:33:37.050
No, no, no, this is negotiation.

437
00:33:39.420 --> 00:33:42.240
So you owe me now, okay?

438
00:33:42.320 --> 00:33:43.460
Just one time, okay?

439
00:33:58.540 --> 00:34:01.530
2/4 minus 3t…

440
00:34:01.610 --> 00:34:02.860
Multiply...

441
00:34:02.940 --> 00:34:03.840
It's funny.

442
00:34:04.450 --> 00:34:06.210
Who decides who is bad?

443
00:34:07.250 --> 00:34:08.950
Am I good or bad?

444
00:34:09.620 --> 00:34:10.480
And you?

445
00:34:11.190 --> 00:34:13.350
Now you need to take
derivative t for each

446
00:34:13.820 --> 00:34:14.920
Then...

447
00:34:15.420 --> 00:34:17.120
3t squared plus...

448
00:34:23.830 --> 00:34:25.500
You failed your midterms.

449
00:34:26.230 --> 00:34:27.940
I called the academy and guess what?

450
00:34:29.200 --> 00:34:30.700
You were always late

451
00:34:31.340 --> 00:34:32.910
and now he’s stopped walking altogether?

452
00:34:34.440 --> 00:34:35.440
Kim Eugyom.

453
00:34:37.850 --> 00:34:38.950
Forgot who you are?

454
00:34:42.450 --> 00:34:44.190
What are you even doing, huh?

455
00:34:49.190 --> 00:34:50.110
Not answering?

456
00:34:50.190 --> 00:34:51.390
Stop it!

457
00:35:00.600 --> 00:35:01.740
Why are you hitting the child?

458
00:35:02.940 --> 00:35:04.660
You can ask first.

459
00:35:04.740 --> 00:35:06.940
Why did he do this, what does he do?

460
00:35:10.850 --> 00:35:11.930
I'm asking.

461
00:35:12.010 --> 00:35:14.080
Can't we talk without assault?

462
00:35:15.780 --> 00:35:16.720
Don't interfere.

463
00:35:17.420 --> 00:35:19.420
He doesn't understand words!

464
00:35:20.190 --> 00:35:22.640
Let's stop this
forced training.

465
00:35:22.720 --> 00:35:23.910
Enough already.

466
00:35:23.990 --> 00:35:26.460
What an excellent student will be
skip classes at the academy?

467
00:35:29.400 --> 00:35:31.200
Your teaching method...

468
00:35:31.830 --> 00:35:34.570
Don't you think that he
only spoils the child?

469
00:35:36.740 --> 00:35:37.640
What?

470
00:35:38.970 --> 00:35:41.080
Because of your teaching method...

471
00:35:41.610 --> 00:35:43.910
He's only getting worse!

472
00:35:51.550 --> 00:35:53.270
Enough.

473
00:35:53.350 --> 00:35:54.290
Stop it.

474
00:35:57.060 --> 00:35:57.990
Hey.

475
00:35:58.830 --> 00:36:00.680
You said you would bring it, didn’t you?

476
00:36:00.760 --> 00:36:02.180
Do you want to make me angry?

477
00:36:02.260 --> 00:36:03.160
No.

478
00:36:03.860 --> 00:36:06.050
You said you would lend me money.

479
00:36:06.130 --> 00:36:07.350
Did he speak or not?

480
00:36:07.430 --> 00:36:08.320
He spoke.

481
00:36:08.400 --> 00:36:10.290
Am I a beggar, huh?

482
00:36:10.370 --> 00:36:11.470
I have no money?

483
00:36:12.170 --> 00:36:14.200
You said you would bring it today!

484
00:36:14.280 --> 00:36:15.910
That's why I didn't take any money with me!

485
00:36:16.440 --> 00:36:18.280
But you say you have no money.

486
00:36:18.880 --> 00:36:20.740
What should I do today then, huh?

487
00:36:20.820 --> 00:36:22.820
Sorry, Kiyun.
I'll definitely bring it tomorrow.

488
00:36:24.950 --> 00:36:26.770
Not tomorrow, but today!

489
00:36:26.850 --> 00:36:28.620
What the hell should I do today?

490
00:36:29.890 --> 00:36:31.880
Why don't they give him the money?

491
00:36:31.960 --> 00:36:35.050
What do they want to do
since Li Kiyun was called?

492
00:36:35.130 --> 00:36:37.080
- Exactly.
- Sorry.

493
00:36:37.160 --> 00:36:38.850
Go get involved.

494
00:36:38.930 --> 00:36:40.100
What can I do?

495
00:36:40.630 --> 00:36:43.020
Damn Lee Kiyun...

496
00:36:43.100 --> 00:36:45.440
Hey, the fat guy is cute, isn't he?

497
00:36:46.110 --> 00:36:48.380
- He has such shoulders!
- I'm going to throw up.

498
00:36:48.940 --> 00:36:49.800
Is he your boyfriend?

499
00:36:49.880 --> 00:36:50.830
What are you talking about?

500
00:36:50.910 --> 00:36:52.470
Those are fat people!

501
00:36:52.550 --> 00:36:55.240
The skin is so soft
If you hit it, your lips will immediately break.

502
00:36:55.320 --> 00:36:56.550
And you can't beat him.

503
00:37:01.520 --> 00:37:02.520
Stand up straight!

504
00:37:04.090 --> 00:37:06.350
Stand up straight, motherfucker, stand up straight!

505
00:37:06.430 --> 00:37:08.180
Angry!

506
00:37:08.260 --> 00:37:09.800
I'm filming!

507
00:37:11.230 --> 00:37:12.320
You come here too.

508
00:37:12.400 --> 00:37:14.160
Damn it!

509
00:37:14.240 --> 00:37:16.900
I'm embarrassed in front of the girls now.

510
00:37:18.140 --> 00:37:19.230
Frenzy.

511
00:37:19.310 --> 00:37:20.260
Send it to me.

512
00:37:20.340 --> 00:37:21.810
Stand up straight.

513
00:37:24.150 --> 00:37:25.950
Funny, right?

514
00:37:26.780 --> 00:37:28.000
Hey.

515
00:37:28.080 --> 00:37:29.640
Did I ask you to bring it?

516
00:37:29.720 --> 00:37:31.290
You said you would bring it!

517
00:37:32.190 --> 00:37:35.090
Stop mocking the weak.

518
00:37:38.890 --> 00:37:41.130
If you don't have money, come to us.

519
00:37:43.030 --> 00:37:45.650
- What the hell is this?
- Do you know him?

520
00:37:45.730 --> 00:37:46.600
What do you need?

521
00:37:49.300 --> 00:37:51.210
We'll make you laugh.

522
00:37:55.080 --> 00:37:56.010
Let's go?

523
00:38:10.620 --> 00:38:12.410
What the hell are these bastards!

524
00:38:12.490 --> 00:38:13.993
- Get out.
- Yes.

525
00:38:14.960 --> 00:38:16.440
Who are you anyway?

526
00:38:27.840 --> 00:38:29.700
- What, do you want to take it off?
- We need to take it off.

527
00:38:29.780 --> 00:38:30.900
- Get up.
- Got up!

528
00:38:30.980 --> 00:38:32.010
Who are you, huh?

529
00:38:40.120 --> 00:38:41.120
Crap!

530
00:39:08.180 --> 00:39:09.120
I'm hungry.

531
00:39:09.580 --> 00:39:10.890
Me too.

532
00:39:15.220 --> 00:39:16.960
Get up, Li Kiyun!

533
00:40:00.370 --> 00:40:03.120
I have to wash it all, damn it!

534
00:40:03.200 --> 00:40:04.070
Everything is fine?

535
00:40:05.840 --> 00:40:07.270
Who are we?

536
00:40:08.080 --> 00:40:12.120
High School Heroes,
who punish the bad guys.

537
00:40:17.750 --> 00:40:18.690
Hey buddy.

538
00:40:20.990 --> 00:40:22.520
Bitches!

539
00:40:24.430 --> 00:40:26.160
I will kill you!

540
00:40:39.840 --> 00:40:43.300
- More.
- Fighting is innate.

541
00:40:43.380 --> 00:40:44.250
Strike again.

542
00:40:52.720 --> 00:40:53.950
Hit!

543
00:41:03.960 --> 00:41:04.870
Cool!

544
00:41:06.800 --> 00:41:07.740
Nice!

545
00:41:10.500 --> 00:41:11.590
That's it.

546
00:41:11.670 --> 00:41:12.570
Get up.

547
00:41:13.110 --> 00:41:14.440
Get up and strike!

548
00:41:15.680 --> 00:41:17.780
You like to hit children.

549
00:41:19.110 --> 00:41:21.380
I will kill you today, just like you!

550
00:41:27.190 --> 00:41:28.060
What are you doing?

551
00:41:29.590 --> 00:41:30.490
Get up.

552
00:41:36.430 --> 00:41:37.530
Where are you crawling?

553
00:41:42.970 --> 00:41:45.340
You mock the weak
and think that you are a king?

554
00:41:54.780 --> 00:41:55.850
Have mercy.

555
00:41:57.050 --> 00:41:57.990
What?

556
00:41:59.090 --> 00:42:00.040
Have mercy.

557
00:42:00.120 --> 00:42:00.980
Fine.

558
00:42:01.060 --> 00:42:02.320
I'll spare you.

559
00:42:32.990 --> 00:42:34.190
Stop it!

